---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = 'Legal notice — PubliTools';
const description = 'Full legal notice of the PubliTools website, published by PubliTech OÜ.';
---
<Layout lang="en" title={title} description={description} canonical="https://publitools.ai/en/legal-notice/" alternateUrl="https://publitools.ai/fr/mentions-legales">
  <main class="container section-pad">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#f4862d]">Legal information</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 max-w-4xl text-5xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#262832]">Legal notice</h1>
    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 text-[#5b6170]">
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">1. Site publisher</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">This website, available under the name PubliTools, is published by <strong class="text-[#262832]">PubliTech OÜ</strong>, a company registered under registry code <strong class="text-[#262832]">17324362</strong>, VAT number <strong class="text-[#262832]">EE102901191</strong>, with registered office at <strong class="text-[#262832]">Harju maakond, Tallinn, Kesklinna linnaosa, Tornimäe tn 5, 10145</strong>.</p>
        <p class="mt-4">PubliTools is the trade name of the tool presented on this site.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">2. Activity</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">The PubliTools website presents and sells software services and digital marketing automation tools designed in particular for contractors, trade businesses and construction companies.</p>
        <p class="mt-4">The features presented may relate to social media, customer review management and local visibility on Google Business.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">3. Hosting and infrastructure</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">The site may be hosted on technical infrastructure operated by specialized third-party providers. Hosting, delivery and availability services may change according to the operational needs of the service.</p>
        <p class="mt-4">All technical elements of the site, including content, visuals, pages, scripts and components, are published under the responsibility of the publisher.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">4. Intellectual property</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">All elements on the site, including texts, visuals, illustrations, logos, graphic elements, components, structural bases, marketing content and distinctive signs, are protected by intellectual property law and remain the exclusive property of PubliTech OÜ or its partners, unless otherwise stated.</p>
        <p class="mt-4">Any reproduction, representation, adaptation, distribution or exploitation, in whole or in part, without prior written authorization, is prohibited.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">5. Liability</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">The publisher strives to ensure the accuracy and updating of the information published on the site. However, it cannot guarantee the absence of errors, omissions, temporary unavailability or occasional inaccuracies.</p>
        <p class="mt-4">The user acknowledges using the site's information under their sole responsibility. The publisher cannot be held liable for direct or indirect damages related to the use of the site or temporary inability to access it.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">6. External links</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">The site may contain links to third-party services or websites. The publisher does not exercise permanent control over these external resources and cannot be held responsible for their content, operation or data processing policies.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">7. Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">For any request relating to the site, published content or PubliTools activity, users can use the contact or appointment booking methods made available on the site.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>